  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 2,
    "fields": {
      "text": "Every map is a promise that the world is smaller than it looks.",
      "media": 1,
      "character": 1,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "adventure",
        "hope"
      ],
      "original_date": "2021-04-16",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 3,
    "fields": {
      "text": "You can be afraid and still be the one who opens the door.",
      "media": 2,
      "character": 2,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "courage",
        "family"
      ],
      "original_date": "2020-09-08",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 4,
    "fields": {
      "text": "The stars don't give directions. They just remind us to look up.",
      "media": 3,
      "character": 3,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "science-fiction",
        "wonder"
      ],
      "original_date": "2023-02-24",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 5,
    "fields": {
      "text": "A good secret is just a truth waiting for the right company.",
      "media": 4,
      "character": 4,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "mystery",
        "friendship"
      ],
      "original_date": "2022-06-03",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 6,
    "fields": {
      "text": "We didn't come this far to let a locked gate have the last word.",
      "media": 5,
      "character": 5,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "determination",
        "adventure"
      ],
      "original_date": "2019-11-15",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 7,
    "fields": {
      "text": "Maybe home is less a place than the people who save you a seat.",
      "media": 6,
      "character": 6,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "belonging",
        "warmth"
      ],
      "original_date": "2024-01-19",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 8,
    "fields": {
      "text": "If the machine can dream, someone has to teach it kindness.",
      "media": 7,
      "character": 7,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "technology",
        "ethics"
      ],
      "original_date": "2022-08-12",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 9,
    "fields": {
      "text": "I know the plan changed. I also know we're still here.",
      "media": 8,
      "character": 8,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "resilience",
        "teamwork"
      ],
      "original_date": "2021-10-01",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 10,
    "fields": {
      "text": "Somewhere between the storm and the shore, I stopped running.",
      "media": 9,
      "character": 9,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "growth",
        "drama"
      ],
      "original_date": "2020-05-22",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 11,
    "fields": {
      "text": "A little wonder is a perfectly practical thing to carry.",
      "media": 10,
      "character": 10,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "optimism",
        "comedy"
      ],
      "original_date": "2023-07-14",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 12,
    "fields": {
      "text": "The past can ride along, but it doesn't get to steer.",
      "media": 11,
      "character": 11,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "redemption",
        "journey"
      ],
      "original_date": "2018-03-30",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 13,
    "fields": {
      "text": "You don't have to win the argument to understand the person.",
      "media": 12,
      "character": 12,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "empathy",
        "relationships"
      ],
      "original_date": "2024-03-08",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 14,
    "fields": {
      "text": "We built a lighthouse because the dark deserved an answer.",
      "media": 13,
      "character": 13,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "community",
        "hope"
      ],
      "original_date": "2019-08-23",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 15,
    "fields": {
      "text": "One honest minute is a better start than a perfect year.",
      "media": 14,
      "character": 14,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "honesty",
        "new-beginnings"
      ],
      "original_date": "2022-12-02",
      "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "model": "quotes.quote",
    "pk": 16,
    "fields": {
      "text": "When the road disappears, we get to decide what counts as forward.",
      "media": 15,
      "character": 15,
      "language": "en",
      "tags": [
        "choice",
        "adventure"
      ],
      "original_date": "2021-01-29",
